sequenceDiagram
    actor Listener
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant Session as Session Manager
    participant Private as Private Repository
    participant Recommender
    participant Public as Built-in Catalog

    Listener->>UI: Enter all canonical song features
    UI->>API: POST private song
    API->>Session: Resolve issued anonymous ID
    Session-->>API: Opaque session ID
    API->>Private: Validate and create private record
    Private-->>UI: Canonical song and user-entered provenance

    Listener->>UI: Request recommendations
    UI->>API: Submit preferences with session cookie
    API->>Public: Load 60 built-in songs
    API->>Private: Load current session songs
    API->>Recommender: Rank combined catalog
    Recommender-->>UI: Grounded deterministic recommendations

    Listener->>UI: Remove private song
    UI->>API: DELETE private song ID
    API->>Private: Delete only within current session
    Private-->>UI: No content
